\newlabel{fig:probe_gap}{{2}{5}{Representation--output gap: per-layer probe $R^2$ (blue) remains above 0.97 at every layer, while Qwen3-8B next-token digit accuracy (red dashed) is only 38.8\% under the stratified sampling used for this figure (38.6\% under the unified-evaluation sampling of Table~\ref {tab:logit_lens}). The shaded region is between what the model \emph {knows} and what it \emph {says}}{figure.caption.15}{}}
